<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>

<section xml:id="objectives" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Specific Learning Objectives for Each Topic </title>
    <introduction>
        <p>
            The objectives below are organized according to the sections of <em>Elementary Real Analysis, Second Edition (2008)</em>, by Brian S. Thompson, Judith B. Bruckner, and Andrew M. Bruckner.  Note that italicized words and phrases are terminology that you are expected to know, understand, and be able to work with.
        </p>
    </introduction>

